OL,3,GNEWSAFood bank sees donations drop by
OL,4,A10% each year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food bank that has seen a drop in
OL,7,Fdonations of about 10% each year since
OL,8,F2023 is hoping government stockpiling
OL,9,Fadvice will not affect the public's
OL,10,Fgenerosity.
OL,12,FSomeone eats a meal provided by
OL,13,FCambridge City Foodbank "every two
OL,14,Fminutes" and it claims to have provided
OL,15,Fmore than 260,000 in the past year.
OL,17,FIn October, the government launched its
OL,18,F"Be Ready" campaign and encouraged
OL,19,Fhouseholds to stock up with enough
OL,20,Fnon-perishable food and water to
OL,21,Fsurvive for three days in case of an
OL,22,Femergency.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
