OL,3,GNEWSAFood bank sees donations drop by
OL,4,A10% each year
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Steve Clay says he does
OL,7,Fnot know if this will affect the
OL,8,FChristmas appeal - their busiest period
OL,9,F- but confesses: "It is a concern."
